## Spine, A-Section

::bg{location="spine-a" time="ship-night"}
::auto{character="vesna" anchor="port" action="drift"}

@vesna{code="0010" emotion="level"}: Hand on the rail. Not the conduit — the rail.
@vesna{code="0020" emotion="clipped"}: It won't warn you twice.
@purser{code="0030" emotion="level" os}: Standby. Module four is scheduled for release in—

<timeline duration="1.6">
  <track channel="sfx">
    ::sfx{sound="klaxon-two-tone" duration="0.6"}
