@narrator{code="0100"}: The rail went cold under your hands, and forty metres of ship stopped being ship.
@vesna{code="0110" emotion="frayed"}: Four was water reclaim.
@vesna{code="0120" emotion="hollowed"}: We were drinking that an hour ago.
/*
  SHORTFALL LEDGER. The Purser's arithmetic is load-bearing and nothing checks it,
  so it is written down once, here, at the first release. Module four goes in this
  scene and leaves the allocation short by TWO; module five goes in ep07 and leaves
  it short by ONE (`spine-b` 0230, and `purser` 0060/0210 restate that one); module
  nine goes in ep11 and satisfies it (`shed`). Listing Ottavio in ep09 adds a body
  to the listed mass and puts it back to TWO (`purser` 0340). Change any of these
  five numbers and change all of them.
*/
@purser{code="0130" emotion="level" os}: Allocation is short by two modules.
@vesna{code="0140" emotion="clipped"}: It says that like it's the weather.
